= The Lost One

The Jedi have finally investigated the death of Sifo-Dyas. He did order the clone army, but he was murdered soon afterwards, and the army's funding was taken over by someone called **Darth Tyranus**: Count Dooku. Records show that the Kamino contract was also overseen by an office in the Republic's own bureaucracy, one that the Senate never authorised.

The leader of the Separatists helped create the Republic's army. Someone is playing both sides of this war.
